{"schemaVersion":2,"type":"languages","id":"dart","latest":"2026-10-05","ranges":{"recent":{"start":"2026-09-29","end":"2026-10-05","count":1,"sources":1},"4w":{"start":"2026-09-08","end":"2026-10-05","count":3,"sources":2},"12w":{"start":"2026-07-14","end":"2026-10-05","count":4,"sources":2}},"projects":[{"url":"https://github.com/none-ptr/globaloverview","tags":["ruanyf-weekly","submission"],"image":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b12bda53-2074-4a14-b81e-a8af43c315af","title":"【开源自荐】GlobalOverview：把 RSS 阅读、AI 出题、单词本塞进一个完全本地的英语学习 App","author":"None-Ptr","github":{"url":"https://github.com/None-Ptr/GlobalOverview","name":"None-Ptr/GlobalOverview","forks":1,"stars":7,"topics":["english","english-learning","english-reading","learning-english","reading-comprehension"],"license":"MIT","archived":false,"homepage":"","language":"Dart","pushedAt":"2026-10-03T08:33:40Z","createdAt":"2026-08-12T10:03:24Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T12:44:08Z","openIssues":1,"description":"A flutter English reading & study app: RSS, AI grading, tap-to-lookup dictionary.","snapshotDate":"2026-10-04","defaultBranch":"main"},"images":["https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b12bda53-2074-4a14-b81e-a8af43c315af","https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca39bc00-2e63-4ca2-9aae-add035d56100","https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c4c7ce3-4357-44b8-8f4f-5e710fe25de1","https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3dbceb2-54a4-4245-b8b8-664b49396c16","https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/427f9e89-bf43-408c-9ad5-a1a3db85520f","https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f47faaf-8214-4a25-bfc9-0986e66b86e3","https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0570f244-d9b8-4743-927e-37203aeda71f"],"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"在使用知名 rss 阅读器 readyou 的时候，有很多优质的英文源，想要通过其锻炼英语能力，又苦与没有与其相适配的练习，所以开发了这个软件 GlobalOverview。 GlobalOverview 基于 flutter 开发，主要用于解决这些问题： 阅读英语文章很方便，但是要真正的时文带练习的还得买各类报刊。 读英文外刊时遇到的生词、想做的题、做错的题没法沉淀成自己的数据，无法形成完整的学习闭环。 常规的报刊没有足够的激励，对学习积极性的要求过高。","issueUrl":"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/12060","sourceId":"weekly-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/None-Ptr","githubUrl":"https://github.com/none-ptr/globaloverview","externalId":"12060","sourceName":"阮一峰周刊·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-10-04T02:22:03Z","sourceIds":["weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_a0afcc870afb91a58a33953c","projectPath":"/projects/none-ptr/globaloverview/","trendDate":"2026-10-04","taxonomy":{"languages":["dart"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/blue-b/spokenlog","tags":["ruanyf-weekly","submission"],"title":"【开源自荐】SpokenLog：录音与转写资料库，可选本地模型或自带 API","author":"Blue-B","github":{"url":"https://github.com/Blue-B/SpokenLog","name":"Blue-B/SpokenLog","forks":0,"stars":4,"topics":[],"license":"AGPL-3.0","archived":false,"homepage":"","language":"Dart","pushedAt":"2026-09-28T02:43:43Z","createdAt":"2026-09-19T17:11:32Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-29T03:29:48Z","openIssues":0,"description":"","snapshotDate":"2026-09-28","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"我做了 SpokenLog，想把录音、转写、回听和修改文字放在同一个应用里，不把录音库绑定在一家转写服务上。 可以选择本地 SenseVoice、Moonshine、Whisper，也可以使用自己的 Groq 或 Cloudflare 凭据。带时间戳的文字能点击回听，改完可导出 TXT、SRT、VTT、JSON。 源码和下载： 支持 Windows 和 Android，也提供 macOS/iOS 构建版本，但当前 Apple 版本还没有在设备上亲自测试。下面是 Windows 实际操作的原速片段，使用合成语音样例。 项目采用 AGPL-3.0-only。界面目前只有英语和韩语。本地转写只接受 WAV，模型需另行下载；云服务的额度和费用另计。Windows 未签名，macOS 未公证，iOS 需要自行重签名。","issueUrl":"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/11969","sourceId":"weekly-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/Blue-B","githubUrl":"https://github.com/blue-b/spokenlog","externalId":"11969","sourceName":"阮一峰周刊·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-28T05:41:15Z","sourceIds":["weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_4ce2b5a55679df291cee9435","projectPath":"/projects/blue-b/spokenlog/","trendDate":"2026-09-28","taxonomy":{"languages":["dart"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/ilgnefz/once_power","tags":["hellogithub","submission"],"image":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dcc9d7aa-ab03-4305-a9be-577d59feb6e9","title":"[开源推荐] OncePower：能一次预览所有图片视频、拖拽定序的批量重命名工具","author":"ilgnefz","github":{"url":"https://github.com/ilgnefz/once_power","name":"ilgnefz/once_power","forks":47,"stars":1069,"topics":["desktop-app","flutter","flutter-demo","flutter-desktop","move-files","rename-files","riverpod","tool"],"license":"GPL-3.0","archived":false,"homepage":"","language":"Dart","pushedAt":"2026-09-27T08:13:15Z","createdAt":"2023-03-22T04:42:06Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-27T08:02:48Z","openIssues":13,"description":"All-in-One Desktop Tool for Batch Rename & Organization, Built with Flutter","snapshotDate":"2026-09-27","defaultBranch":"master"},"images":["https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dcc9d7aa-ab03-4305-a9be-577d59feb6e9","https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/046fda65-ae05-42fa-8ed4-8e07b12d24b4","https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1ed82f7-65a1-4072-8b07-4a6aeb6e6227"],"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"OncePower 是一款 Flutter + Rust 写的开源桌面端批量重命名与文件整理工具，支持 Windows / Linux（暂需自行通过项目 Action 打包）、中英双语。它解决的是整理照片和视频素材时的典型痛点：边看内容边定顺序、再批量改名。所有规则可视化配置，不需要学正则也能完成高级匹配替换。 亮点 1. 视图模式：列表里直接显示图片缩略图，双击看大图，视频可直接播放并自动生成封面——不用先切到资源管理器确认\"这到底是哪个文件\"。 2. 拖拽即命名顺序：拖动列表项就能调整顺序，拖出来的顺序就是编号 / 序列命名的顺序；配合 Ctrl / Shift 多选和暂存区做批量搬移，全程所见即所得，不用\"改完名再看效果、不对再改\"。 3. 不用学正则：替换、保留、高级模式（删除 / 添加 / 序列 / 随机数 / 转换 / 格式化 / 单词间隔）全是可视化选项；常用规则可存成\"预设\"反复复用。 4. 组模式：不同组套用不同的命名规则，一批文件一次搞定多种命名风格。 5. CSV / TXT 导入命名：外部改好名称表直接导入；也能导入它自己生成的日志，一键还原成原来的文件名。 6. 整理模式：改完名可直接按组 / 类型 / 日期把文件移动到不同文件夹，顺带清理空文件夹。 7. 系统右键菜单集成（Windows）＋ 开机自启，在资源管理器里右键就能把文件塞进列表（需自行开启该功能）。 截图或演示视频 以下动图为了减少体积进行过删帧，所以看起来会有点卡顿","issueUrl":"https://github.com/521xueweihan/HelloGitHub/issues/3787","sourceId":"hellogithub-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/ilgnefz","githubUrl":"https://github.com/ilgnefz/once_power","externalId":"3787","sourceName":"HelloGitHub·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-27T08:39:29Z","sourceIds":["hellogithub-issues"],"productId":"prd_0bb7fe9f5db4e0682cdd886c","projectPath":"/projects/ilgnefz/once_power/","trendDate":"2026-09-27","taxonomy":{"languages":["dart"]}},{"url":"htt